[b]New character: Soul Shifter[/b]
In human form, the possessed person can exchange positions with any player. The forward movement time is 2 seconds, and the other party will receive an early warning. When swapping positions, both sides will produce smoke and casting sound effects. CD time is 1 minute. Can be used during the stealth phase before and after transformation.
The soul shifter is the only possessed person who can achieve remote transformation, and can also bring other people to the murder scene to frame the crime.

[b]GAME FEATURES[/b]
You can now choose your own camp tendency in the room interface, which are possessed, servants, survivors, and random. Choosing a camp tendency will increase the probability of being randomly assigned to this camp, but it is not 100%.

[b]BALANCE[/b]
●The needle movement time is reduced from 3 seconds to 1.5 seconds;
●The price of silver ingot is reduced from 5 to 4, and the price of gold ingot is increased from 6 to 7;
●Increase the penalty for continuous empty knife: when the empty knife is used 1/2/3 times in a row, 85% / 65% / 50% of the energy will be returned. After the third empty knife, each empty knife will trigger a meeting;
●Life-killing chain can only be purchased when there are no more than 6 surviving players on the field;
●The CD of the empty knife is increased from 40 seconds to 45 seconds;
●The extra time gained for each person killed in the life-killing chain is reduced from 10 seconds to 8 seconds;
●NPC can now open doors;
●Now the little girl will follow the target faster. When the distance is far away, the little girl will flash in front of the target;

[b]ART[/b]
●New game characters: Wang Laqi, Zhu Daqiang;
●Face-to-face killing animation updated;
●When the Ghost Bride is close, the heartbeat will speed up;

[b]BUG FIX[/b]
●Fixed the bug that caused the possessed person's wheat to be unusable in the lobby interface after the game ended in scarlet;
●Fixed the bug that the grid did not increase after the possessed person purchased backpack components;
●Fixed the bug of using crystals in boxes to copy items;
●Fixed the bug that the backpack and props could not be used normally after disconnection and reconnection;
●Fix the bug of painting skin in some cases;
●Fixed the issue of jamming in some cases;
●Fixed the bug where everyone’s number plates flashed by just before dawn;
